 @PolarIceCreamery  I spent the day adjusting my recipes to look similar to yours using the excel ice cream calculator you showed in your chocolate video. The texture is night and day. So creamy. 

I actually ended up trying the Zanzibar chocolate I mentioned to you. It was a slight variation of your valhrona 2.0 recipe except I added Dutch chocolate powder, malt powder, 70% dark chocolate, and some espresso. The chocolate was very rich. Very creamy. Not bitter but knocked on the door. I can post the recipe if you’re interested. 

Your videos are amazing man!
